# Ignore R history
Code/.Rhistory

# Ignore all files inside Models and its subdirectories
Code/Models/**
# But don't ignore the directories themselves
!Code/Models/**/

# Ignore all files inside Datasets and its subdirectories
Code/Datasets/**
# But don't ignore the directories themselves
!Code/Datasets/**/

# Specifically ignore .rds files everywhere (optional safety)
*.rds
*.uwot